SUMMARY:Part Closure: BARONS COURT STATION: From Monday 6 July until 
 November\, westbound trains will not call at Barons Court. If travelling 
 westbound from the station\, please use eastbound District or Piccadilly 
 line trains and change to westbound services at West Kensington (on the 
 District line) or Earls Court (on the Piccadilly line) and change to 
 westbound services. If travelling westbound to the station\, please 
 continue to Hammersmith and change for eastbound District or Piccadilly 
 line trains.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTAMP:20260926T093047Z
UID:f486256d-b98c-11f1-a931-0022488f0801
DTSTART:20260926
DTEND:20260928
SUMMARY:Part Closure: PICCADILLY LINE: From 0200 Saturday 26 and all day 
 Sunday 27 September (including Friday and Saturday Night Tube)\, no 
 service between Cockfosters and Uxbridge. Trains continue to operate 
 between Acton Town and Heathrow. Use DISTRICT LINE trains between Central 
 London and Acton Town / Ealing Common and METROPOLITAN LINE trains between
  Rayners Lane and Uxbridge. Use ELIZABETH LINE trains for travel between 
 Central London and Heathrow. Replacement buses operate.
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR